{"v":2,"id":"01M8GW5C5JZSVF29W0MZAZ5JBT","ts":"2026-11-28T10:45:37.074022Z","actor":"owner","type":"goal.add","node":"01M8GW5C5JZSVF29W0MZAZ5JBT","payload":{"role":"owner","words":"A rethink page holds its items as data that a shipped checker refuses when they are wrong, and the skills that write and read the page ship with hyp.","base":"c3da6df70eb5d585a84493e0638a1fc922b83297","base_tree":"d2efa64f3152b094ef12661111250eefd1a470ca","budget":3,"from":"","lines":[{"key":"line-1","text":"skills/hyp-rethinking and skills/hyp-bayes-thinking ship with hyp, and each names the other by its new name.","kind":"gap"},{"key":"line-2","text":"hyp-rethinking ships a copy of public-doc-voice as one of its references and loads it from there; it names no skill that hyp does not ship.","kind":"gap"},{"key":"line-3","text":"The checker that hyp-rethinking ships refuses a page's data file with exit 1, naming each defect by a code and a path: an item with no id, a duplicate id, an id that does not start with the page's id, a tag other than Owner said, Proposed, Open, Fact or Hypothetical, or an unknown field; it exits 2 when a file cannot be read or written, and 0 on a whole file.","kind":"gap"},{"key":"line-4","text":"A script that hyp-rethinking ships draws the whole page from its data file, the diagrams included: the page declares its parties once, and each approach gives only where the concept sits and its numbered event steps, so all three diagrams share one canvas.","kind":"gap"},{"key":"line-5","text":"When the owner replaces an item, a proposal or the owner's own words, the item keeps its id and shows only its new words and date; the page shows no \"replaced\" marker.","kind":"gap"},{"key":"line-6","text":"The checker also refuses a page whose sections are out of order, that refers to a missing section, that repeats an HTML id, that has a sentence over 25 words, or whose approach has no diagram.","kind":"gap"}],"examples":[{"line":"line-1","example":"a","hash":"9a2d9c3169231bbc41f38733564a64805ad4b7f6","h0":{"commit":"c3da6df70eb5d585a84493e0638a1fc922b83297","row_tree":"d2efa64f3152b094ef12661111250eefd1a470ca","probe":"3a7334686c13a115e2636e07896004970fafea34","exit":0,"verdict":"failed"}},{"line":"line-1","example":"b","hash":"40b53a678ab3356dcd6f3888adf896d3b37edd1a","h0":{"commit":"c3da6df70eb5d585a84493e0638a1fc922b83297","row_tree":"d2efa64f3152b094ef12661111250eefd1a470ca","probe":"3a7334686c13a115e2636e07896004970fafea34","exit":0,"verdict":"failed"}},{"line":"line-2","example":"a","hash":"90d684e19a0cbabe9aecc80a459af2dbd82d1c09","h0":{"commit":"c3da6df70eb5d585a84493e0638a1fc922b83297","row_tree":"d2efa64f3152b094ef12661111250eefd1a470ca","probe":"3a7334686c13a115e2636e07896004970fafea34","exit":0,"verdict":"failed"}},{"line":"line-2","example":"b","hash":"71bce45c71f0440ed4cd868b613ac3b8fd620cbc","h0":{"commit":"c3da6df70eb5d585a84493e0638a1fc922b83297","row_tree":"d2efa64f3152b094ef12661111250eefd1a470ca","probe":"3a7334686c13a115e2636e07896004970fafea34","exit":0,"verdict":"failed"}},{"line":"line-3","example":"a","hash":"15b2932e900728260534fe956a3494aa3cfcb02c","h0":{"commit":"c3da6df70eb5d585a84493e0638a1fc922b83297","row_tree":"d2efa64f3152b094ef12661111250eefd1a470ca","probe":"3a7334686c13a115e2636e07896004970fafea34","exit":0,"verdict":"failed"}},{"line":"line-3","example":"b","hash":"037ceede95eee45bb4db55f15dcb21144e0d7b10","h0":{"commit":"c3da6df70eb5d585a84493e0638a1fc922b83297","row_tree":"d2efa64f3152b094ef12661111250eefd1a470ca","probe":"3a7334686c13a115e2636e07896004970fafea34","exit":0,"verdict":"failed"}},{"line":"line-3","example":"b-field-unknown","hash":"839be5e7715c8bdd9e3eb0803d90c66507b480b8","h0":{"commit":"c3da6df70eb5d585a84493e0638a1fc922b83297","row_tree":"d2efa64f3152b094ef12661111250eefd1a470ca","probe":"3a7334686c13a115e2636e07896004970fafea34","exit":0,"verdict":"failed"}},{"line":"line-3","example":"b-id-duplicate","hash":"6847303467d86443fbb76f8e018a8ff4bc454785","h0":{"commit":"c3da6df70eb5d